Azan Duo – Privacy Policy

Last updated: 22 October 2026

Azan Duo does not require an account, shows no ads, and does not track you. We do not collect, store on our servers, sell or share any personal data.

Location

If you allow it, the app uses your device location only to calculate prayer times and the Qibla direction. The location is processed on your device and is never uploaded or shared.

City search

When you search for a city, the text you type is sent to Apple Maps to find it. Your location is not sent, and we do not receive or store the search.

Notifications

Prayer reminders are local notifications scheduled on your device. No notification data leaves your device.

Data stored on your device

Your settings (city, language, calculation method) and your tasbih counter are stored only on your device.

Widgets and Apple Watch

Widgets and the Apple Watch app use your saved settings and the calculated prayer times. They are shared between your iPhone, widgets and Apple Watch on your own devices only, and are never sent to us.

Purchases

The optional Lifetime purchase is handled entirely by Apple. We do not see or store your payment details.

Third parties

The app contains no third-party analytics, advertising or tracking software.

Children

The app does not knowingly collect data from anyone, including children.

Changes and contact

If this policy changes, we will update this page. Questions: [hcigdemkaraca@gmail.com]
